    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709440/extras/295bad74aea544bd60168576d9eae31d.avif?t=1735020159\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc45 Kawaii Pleasure Heaven\u00a0\ud83d\udc45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kawaii Jigsaw is a relaxing puzzle game that you can play with one hand! Naughty girls in their most seductive poses await you\u00a0\ud83d\ude18</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc8b Nine exclusive kawaii girls to take home with viewable gallery \ud83d\udc8b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f Unlock <i>Hentai</i> mode for maximum pleasure (18+)\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udd25 Customize your challenge with puzzle sizes ranging from 6 to 96 pieces \ud83d\udd25</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udca6 Climaxing timed mode \ud83d\udca6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709440/extras/3f00ebae4f04ac502514ffd8baea8449.avif?t=1735020159\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709440/extras/295bad74aea544bd60168576d9eae31d.avif?t=1735020159\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udc45 Kawaii Pleasure Heaven\u00a0\ud83d\udc45</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Kawaii Jigsaw is a relaxing puzzle game that you can play with one hand! Naughty girls in their most seductive poses await you\u00a0\ud83d\ude18</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udc8b Nine exclusive kawaii girls to take home with viewable gallery \ud83d\udc8b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2764\ufe0f Unlock <i>Hentai</i> mode for maximum pleasure (18+)\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udd25 Customize your challenge with puzzle sizes ranging from 6 to 96 pieces \ud83d\udd25</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> \ud83d\udca6 Climaxing timed mode \ud83d\udca6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1709440/extras/3f00ebae4f04ac502514ffd8baea8449.avif?t=1735020159\" /></div></p></li></ul>",
